.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# data/snapshots is a symlink to ~/Library/Application Support/apex-fpl/snapshots
# (kept outside ~/Documents due to macOS TCC restrictions on launchd — see
# docs/fpl_gap_analysis.md and research/research_plan.md). The symlink itself
# is fine to track; the actual snapshot payloads are not source and are large.
data/snapshots/**
data/logs/
data/canonical/
artifacts/

# data/raw/ (Phase 13 pipeline captures, data/raw/gw{n}/*.json) is
# deliberately NOT ignored -- CLAUDE.md documents it as a committed,
# immutable raw-capture tier alongside the prediction/result ledgers,
# and every prediction's data_sources[].sha256 only means anything if
# the file it points at is actually in the repo. It had been caught by
# this blanket rule since before Phase 13 existed; ~360KB/file, small
# enough that committing it forever is not a real storage concern.

# Files carved out of the data/external/ blanket ignore because the
# LIVE prediction path (not just tests/backtesting) reads them --
# CANONICAL_ROOT for why. Both gaps found the same way: the first two
# live workflow runs crashed on FileNotFoundError, since these were
# previously assumed to be dev-machine-local, test-only fixtures.
#   - fixtures.csv + teams.csv, 2024-25 only: apex_fpl.serving.
#     live_data.build_team_model_fixtures()'s fallback team-strength
#     prior (TEAM_MODEL_FALLBACK_SEASONS).
#   - merged_gw.csv, the 4 seasons scripts/run_production_
#     recommendation.py's COLD_START_MINUTES_TRAIN_SEASONS names: the
#     cold-start minutes model's real historical GW1 training rows.
# If either constant changes, this carve-out needs to change with it --
# see CLAUDE.md.
data/external/*
!data/external/vaastav/
data/external/vaastav/*
!data/external/vaastav/2020-21/
!data/external/vaastav/2022-23/
!data/external/vaastav/2023-24/
!data/external/vaastav/2024-25/
data/external/vaastav/2020-21/*
data/external/vaastav/2022-23/*
data/external/vaastav/2023-24/*
data/external/vaastav/2024-25/*
!data/external/vaastav/2020-21/merged_gw.csv
!data/external/vaastav/2022-23/merged_gw.csv
!data/external/vaastav/2023-24/merged_gw.csv
!data/external/vaastav/2024-25/merged_gw.csv
!data/external/vaastav/2024-25/fixtures.csv
!data/external/vaastav/2024-25/teams.csv
